msgid "In the process above, we calculated a kernel matrix entry for the 14th and 19th data points. What value should we obtain if we use the same data point twice, here (like 14th and 14th again)? In other words, what should be the diagonal entries in the kernel matrix? Answer this question in the absence of noise, but note that deviations from your answer are possible in the presence of noise.\n"
